      <summary>Verifier round 1 (23 items) — every code item closed; remaining items are the recorded escalations and manual gates. Full per-item disposition: notes/task-146-server-child-writers.md §11.</summary>
      <changes>(1) associate-record now authorizes AS THE CALLER before re-filing: Write on the body document + AppendTo on the target (the body-declared per-record filter, reused); RecordMatchEndpoints.cs joined RouteAuthorizationGuardTests (match-records = Pending UNOWNED waiver, pre-existing). (2) Event re-file: ONE derivation (UpdateEventRequest.RegardingLookupWrites) feeds both the PATCH (now writes the regarding lookups by live-verified nav prop, clears the previous type's) and the reparent; re-file authorized as the caller (Write on the event, AppendTo on the target). (3) Content rows of a creator-owned but FILED parent resolve from the parent's own filing (unfiled keeps the creator). (4) Inbound + upload-capture owners include the FR-26 stamps (same derivation the apply writes); an undeterminable filing HOLDS inbound mail (new code record_owner_parent_undetermined) and skips an upload capture. (6) Census: per-SITE owner writes; escalated run-as-user writers named; every run-as-user POST classified; write-path I-2 states the real guard scope. (8) Null clears are re-files (generic update handler + UpdateRecordActionCore); a change touching no parent decides no owner. (9) Event status log owner resolved before any write. (10) Outbound send: record + owner prepared BEFORE the send (409 / fault, nothing sent). (7) Fixture comment corrected.</changes>
